Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 08:44:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 28/49] authz: Implement resource managers, client contexts and
 AuthzAccessCheck().

Also add semi-stubs for the object access audit event functions. Used by
the WMI service to check access of its clients.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016s12iuoTmYVZJQsft4SbDV
